id: pm-github-aplb
title: Closeout workflow tests race the detached telemetry flush when removing their temporary global root
description: "The 2026.10.16 release run 38867443956 failed in Run release checks: test/closeout-workflow.test.ts 'compact PR summary is privacy gated before the bot branch is published' threw ENOTEMPTY removing <tmp>/global/runtime/telemetry. The pm CLI's detached telemetry flush (upstream pm-cli#1423; follow-up #1484) can still write under PM_GLOBAL_PATH when the caller removes it. The same race hit PR #133 CI. import-gate.test.ts already retries its global-root removal (maxRetries 5, retryDelay 100); the closeout fixture did not."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[4]: ci,fixed,flaky,tests
created_at: "2026-10-16T07:43:14.293Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-16T08:41:48.891Z"
author: claude-orchestrator
acceptance_criteria: closeout-workflow.test.ts fixture removal retries like import-gate.test.ts; Release run succeeds
expected_result: Fixture teardown tolerates a concurrent detached flush write
actual_result: Release run 38867443956 and PR #133 CI failed with ENOTEMPTY during fixture teardown
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-16T07:52:14.347Z",claude-orchestrator,"Fix: closeout-workflow.test.ts fixture teardown now retries the temp-root removal (maxRetries 10, retryDelay 100), matching import-gate.test.ts. Local CI-like run (fresh HOME, no global git config, no GH tokens, built dist): node --test test/closeout-workflow.test.ts 20/20 pass. Root cause upstream: detached telemetry flush writes under PM_GLOBAL_PATH after the CLI exits (pm-cli#1423 fixed root resurrection only; follow-up pm-cli#1484 filed)."
  "2026-10-16T08:41:48.891Z",claude-orchestrator,"Review round 1 (CodeRabbit): finite rmSync retries cannot outlast a detached flush that may write up to the HTTP timeout later. Both disposable-global-root fixtures (closeout-workflow, import-gate) now set PM_TELEMETRY_INLINE_FLUSH=1 (documented test knob in pm docs/CONFIGURATION.md: flush inline instead of dispatching the detached worker; delivery unchanged). The retry stays as defensive cleanup. Local CI-like run: closeout-workflow 20/20; import-gate has 11 failures locally that reproduce on unchanged main in this host environment (baseline probe), so GitHub CI is the arbiter."
files[1]{path,scope}:
  test/closeout-workflow.test.ts,project
body: ""
